# ALL.mask -- line masks for gate_cases_prolog (FORMAT: entry<TAB>python-regex<TAB>reason; a row with an empty reason is refused), read by corpus_suite_harness.py read_mask_sidecar() and by the builder before its two-run comparison. A masked line is replaced in both streams, never deleted.
